      <ul>
        {twoPathsComparison.teal.map((item) => (
          <li>{item}</li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>
    Neither track is the "wrong" choice. The mistake is not choosing consciously between them before spending
    years and real money on an MSc or PhD assuming the destination will sort itself out.
  </p>

